All Staves under 25 Magick Attack stat can be upgraded via the [[Blacksmith]]. Upgrading does not affect the substats or skills that weapon provides, only the base stats.
==Equippable By==
Staves are used by the following classes, but many have restrictions on which magick classes can use them. Detailed info on each can be found in the table itself:
*[[Witch]]/[[Sorceress]]
*[[Wizard]]/[[Warlock]]
*[[Shaman]]/[[Druid]]
*[[Cleric]]/[[Bishop]]
*[[Priestess]]/[[High Priestess]]
*[[Wereowl]]
*[[Featherstaff]]
*[[Dark Marquess (Staff)]]
